der of the fresh-tasting falafel. The service is always friendly. They always offer to give me more bread than I need. Hmm, I guess that is not really a negative when they want to give me more stuff? Check this place out if you are a fan of middle-eastern food and want something fresh."},{"business_id":"BokW_cq-5ZIKP2kvLtzrNQ","review_id":"z73UQqQlYEuYU5CLRge8vw","date":"2018-10-10T17:46:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9516443610191345,"text_excerpt":"I came here to return something and stopped to eat lunch at Mona's. It was was hot fresh and delicious. The only kinda bad thing was there was this green chile sauce or something on the hummus. It can be loft off! Will be back!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
